    "Verbs like _possum_ ‘I can’, _dēbeō_ ‘I ought’, _volō_ ‘I want’ are completed by an **infinitive**: _Ōrāre dēbēmus_ ‘We ought to pray’; _Vidēre nōn poterant_ ‘They could not see’."
